<h2 id="aprendizaje">What I learned <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i> </h2>
<p> 
  • Cookies — Small files that store information in the user's browser, such as preferences. <br /> 
  • Locale files — Files that contain language translations to internationalize an application. <br /> 
  • Automatic email sending — Feature that lets an application schedule and send emails automatically. <br /> 
  • .env files — Documents that store environment variables (such as keys or settings) outside the main code for greater security. <br /> 
  • New graphic design modules: Font Awesome and Flag Icons — Icon libraries that make it easier to add graphics and flags to web interfaces. <br /> 
</p>
